// A comment thread: comments contain replies, which are comments again.
// Data like this is recursive, and so is its type (see thread.schema.haus).
//
// The discussion below is 15 levels deep. Hover `replies` in VS Code: the
// inferred type is `Array Comment`, with one recursive `type Comment = …`.
//
// Before the fix in the design review (S10), the type was unrolled 15 times
// and printing it took 4x longer with every level: 10 levels took 6 s,
// 12 levels 92 s, and this file would have frozen the language server for
// well over an hour. Now it takes under a millisecond.

Comment {
  author: "ada",
  at: Instant("2026-11-01T09:00:00Z"),
  text: "Should haus have null?",
  likes: 0,
  replies: [
    Comment {
      author: "bob",
      at: Instant("2026-11-02T09:00:00Z"),
      text: "JSON has it, people expect it.",
      likes: 2,
      replies: [
        Comment {
          author: "ada",
          at: Instant("2026-11-03T09:00:00Z"),
          text: "But then a missing field and null mean almost the same thing.",
          likes: 4,
          replies: [
            Comment {
              author: "bob",
              at: Instant("2026-11-04T09:00:00Z"),
              text: "Almost is fine in practice.",
              likes: 1,
              replies: [
                Comment {
                  author: "ada",
                  at: Instant("2026-11-05T09:00:00Z"),
                  text: "Not for PATCH: 'leave it' and 'clear it' are different requests.",
                  likes: 3,
                  replies: [
                    Comment {
                      author: "bob",
                      at: Instant("2026-11-06T09:00:00Z"),
                      text: "Then send a separate list of fields to clear.",
                      likes: 0,
                      replies: [
                        Comment {
                          author: "ada",
                          at: Instant("2026-11-07T09:00:00Z"),
                          text: "That's a second format inside the first one.",
                          likes: 2,
                          replies: [
                            Comment {
                              author: "bob",
                              at: Instant("2026-11-08T09:00:00Z"),
                              text: "Fine. What about Option types then?",
                              likes: 4,
                              replies: [
                                Comment {
                                  author: "ada",
                                  at: Instant("2026-11-09T09:00:00Z"),
                                  text: "None is just a tag, so it needs no keyword.",
                                  likes: 1,
                                  replies: [
                                    Comment {
                                      author: "bob",
                                      at: Instant("2026-11-10T09:00:00Z"),
                                      text: "And True and False are tags too?",
                                      likes: 3,
                                      replies: [
                                        Comment {
                                          author: "ada",
                                          at: Instant("2026-11-11T09:00:00Z"),
                                          text: "Yes, Bool is a variant like any other.",
                                          likes: 0,
                                          replies: [
                                            Comment {
                                              author: "bob",
                                              at: Instant(
                                                "2026-11-12T09:00:00Z",
                                              ),
                                              text: "So the prelude decides what they mean.",
                                              likes: 2,
                                              replies: [
                                                Comment {
                                                  author: "ada",
                                                  at: Instant(
                                                    "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
                                                  ),
                                                  text: "And the parser stays small.",
                                                  likes: 4,
                                                  replies: [
                                                    Comment {
                                                      author: "bob",
                                                      at: Instant(
                                                        "2026-11-14T09:00:00Z",
                                                      ),
                                                      text: "I'm convinced. Mostly.",
                                                      likes: 1,
                                                      replies: [
                                                        Comment {
                                                          author: "ada",
                                                          at: Instant(
                                                            "2026-11-15T09:00:00Z",
                                                          ),
                                                          text: "Mostly is fine in practice.",
                                                          likes: 3,
                                                          replies: [],
                                                        },
                                                      ],
                                                    },
                                                  ],
                                                },
                                              ],
                                            },
                                          ],
                                        },
                                      ],
